87
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my dear cousin.</font></font>

88
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:53,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your greed and cruelty forced my hand</font></font>

89
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,120
