92
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and to protect those beggars,</font></font>

93
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd go this far?</font></font>

94
00:05:04,630 --> 00:05:05,870
