96
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've brought utter disgrace on our family!</font></font>

97
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you hit me?</font></font>

98
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble blood? What a joke.</font></font>

99
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My father died fighting for this country.</font></font>

100
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A hero's blood runs in my veins.</font></font>

101
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And you</font></font>

102
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">used the honor he paid for in blood to marry into royalty,</font></font>

103
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then turned around and trampled on his daughter.</font></font>

104
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your horses</font></font>

105
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">trampled the people's fertile fields.</font></font>

106
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:39,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You betrayed the people who sustain the nobility</font></font>

107
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the country</font></font>

108
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">made up of those millions of people.</font></font>

109
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the real traitors.</font></font>

110
