121
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

122
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And for all your scheming and helping him commit his crimes,</font></font>

123
