146
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll tear you limb from limb!</font></font>

147
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

148
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:35,120
