149
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and laughed with delight.</font></font>

150
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You never would've imagined</font></font>

151
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:42,030
