165
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't leave me here!</font></font>

166
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know I was wrong!</font></font>

167
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

168
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be careful.</font></font>

169
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:36,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo?</font></font>

170
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:44,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Greetings, Your Majesty.</font></font>

171
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened here?</font></font>

172
00:09:46,170 --> 00:09:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The rabble have rebelled. Hurry.</font></font>

173
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Arrest them at once!</font></font>

174
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord, it's Her Ladyship.</font></font>

175
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My dear,</font></font>

176
00:10:02,670 --> 00:10:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">while you were away,</font></font>

177
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they all ganged up on me.</font></font>

178
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lies!</font></font>

179
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:10,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You silver-tongued, venomous snake!</font></font>

180
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:14,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Han Liao coerced Madam Liu into lying to Her Majesty.</font></font>

181
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He falsely accused me of lying about my identity</font></font>

182
00:10:16,790 --> 00:10:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and deceiving His Majesty.</font></font>

183
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He even tried to parade me through the streets,</font></font>

184
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which angered the people.</font></font>

185
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In their outrage,</font></font>

186
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they overturned the imperial carriage</font></font>

187
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:28,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and frightened Her Majesty.</font></font>

188
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see.</font></font>

189
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, you're an imperial official.</font></font>

190
00:10:34,390 --> 00:10:35,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You mustn't let personal feelings</font></font>

191
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">lead you to shield this woman.</font></font>

192
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her Majesty has ordered you</font></font>

193
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:40,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to arrest the rebels!</font></font>

194
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The estate has taken in countless displaced people.</font></font>

195
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Your Majesty wants me to arrest them all,</font></font>

196
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid</font></font>

197
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">prisoners will fill the streets and pack the prisons.</font></font>

198
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even ten more imperial prisons</font></font>

199
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">won't hold them all.</font></font>

200
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't play dumb.</font></font>

201
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The people Her Majesty ordered you to arrest</font></font>

202
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are Noble Lady Wu'an's accomplices!</font></font>

203
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My wife's growing reputation draws people from far and wide.</font></font>

204
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even from 1,000 li away,</font></font>

205
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">people keep coming to seek her protection.</font></font>

206
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tell me, in all the realm,</font></font>

207
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:09,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">among those with a conscience,</font></font>

208
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who counts as her accomplice?</font></font>

209
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And who doesn't?</font></font>

210
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu, this woman</font></font>

211
00:11:16,870 --> 00:11:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has blinded you.</font></font>

212
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You even dare defy my decree now.</font></font>

213
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:24,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Both she and her mother are seductresses!</font></font>

214
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel dizzy.</font></font>

215
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take you back.</font></font>

216
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:41,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...!</font></font>

217
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

218
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back to the palace!</font></font>

219
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Guards!</font></font>

220
00:11:49,550 --> 00:11:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Escort me back to the palace!</font></font>

221
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo,</font></font>

222
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this isn't over.</font></font>

223
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:58,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When His Majesty returns, you'll answer for this.</font></font>

224
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's taking my horse!</font></font>

225
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Satisfied?</font></font>

226
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I intend to make that old wretch choke on her rage.</font></font>

227
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:27,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're burning up,</font></font>

228
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet you're still running around?</font></font>

229
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still have business to take care of.</font></font>

230
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're going back.</font></font>

231
00:12:38,500 --> 00:12:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Caishu Hall]</font></font>

232
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Every breeze in this world feels the same♪</font></font>

233
00:12:52,220 --> 00:12:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But when you pass by, the wind takes shape...♪</font></font>

234
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:04,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">First, tell me where</font></font>

235
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're holding the Crown Prince.</font></font>

236
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:09,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That Crown Prince is such a coward.</font></font>

237
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The people gave him a fright,</font></font>

238
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and he vanished without a trace.</font></font>

239
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't know where he is now.</font></font>

240
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Every view in this world seems the same...♪</font></font>

241
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll find him even if you won't tell me.</font></font>

242
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's my grandmother?</font></font>

243
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's in a guest room.</font></font>

244
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should go and see her</font></font>

245
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so she won't worry.</font></font>

246
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪It falls upon my heart warm and bright...♪</font></font>

247
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:47,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aman,</font></font>

248
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">go and tell Grandmother I'm all right.</font></font>

249
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I must rest and recover,</font></font>

250
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as my husband says.</font></font>

251
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:56,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

252
00:13:57,580 --> 00:14:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I care not where we go, only that you're by my side♪</font></font>

253
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We'll breathe in flowers and watch the moss grow♪</font></font>

254
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:22,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Through all the years ahead, may we walk together♪</font></font>

255
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Flourishing Like the Pines]</font></font>

256
00:14:36,550 --> 00:14:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is the Crown Prince?</font></font>

257
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu,</font></font>

258
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:40,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we haven't...</font></font>

259
00:14:40,190 --> 00:14:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Think twice before you answer.</font></font>

260
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lady Rao has caused a major crisis.</font></font>

261
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you won't tell me the truth now,</font></font>

262
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she'll have to defend herself before His Majesty while ill.</font></font>

263
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's seriously ill.</font></font>

264
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:53,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you want to kill her?</font></font>

265
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu,</font></font>

266
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll tell you the truth.</font></font>

267
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Crown Prince ran off blindly</font></font>

268
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and accidentally fell into a hunting pit.</font></font>

269
00:15:02,510 --> 00:15:04,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I rushed back to report to Her Ladyship.</font></font>

270
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just about to fetch ropes</font></font>

271
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and a sedan chair to bring him back.</font></font>

272
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of all the things you could learn from her,</font></font>

273
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've learned only how to evade questions</font></font>

274
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and deceive people.</font></font>

275
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're right to reprimand me.</font></font>

276
00:15:17,750 --> 00:15:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come along!</font></font>

277
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Changle Palace]</font></font>

278
00:15:24,770 --> 00:15:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why haven't you sent troops to rescue the Crown Prince</font></font>

279
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:28,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and arrest Wu'an?</font></font>

280
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:29,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Han Liao,</font></font>

281
00:15:30,670 --> 00:15:33,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you mean to defy my decree too?</font></font>

282
00:15:34,630 --> 00:15:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please calm down, Your Majesty.</font></font>

283
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:38,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My life and fortunes depend entirely on you.</font></font>

284
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I dare disobey?</font></font>

285
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can't hide this uprising from His Majesty.</font></font>

286
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He has surely been informed by now.</font></font>

287
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao incited the people to rebel.</font></font>

288
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That crime warrants the extermination of her entire clan.</font></font>

289
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:53,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty won't spare her.</font></font>

290
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about the Crown Prince?</font></font>

291
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's His Majesty's own son.</font></font>

292
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">However grave his crimes,</font></font>

293
00:16:00,790 --> 00:16:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only His Majesty can judge his case.</font></font>

294
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Others have no right to interfere.</font></font>

295
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao would never dare kill His Highness.</font></font>

296
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At most, she'll make him suffer a little longer.</font></font>

297
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said</font></font>

298
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:15,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we could charge her with treason?</font></font>

299
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Everlasting Glory]</font></font>

300
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As the ringleader of this treason,</font></font>

301
00:16:19,550 --> 00:16:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she should die by slow slicing.</font></font>

302
00:16:23,570 --> 00:16:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's brought this on herself.</font></font>

303
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Traitor! You traitor!</font></font>

304
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:06,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu, please have me taken home to recover.</font></font>

305
00:17:07,070 --> 00:17:09,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Song, escort His Highness home.</font></font>

306
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

307
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, Wu'an,</font></font>

308
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">one day I'll tear you both limb from limb</font></font>

309
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and grind your bones to dust!</font></font>

310
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu, the Crown Prince fell by accident.</font></font>

311
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you expect me to believe that?</font></font>

312
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her Ladyship said, "If we're going to do this,</font></font>

313
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we must finish the job.</font></font>

314
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave him to rot in that pit</font></font>

315
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">until nothing remains but bones in eight or ten years.</font></font>

316
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if the truth comes out,</font></font>

317
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">taking the Crown Prince down with us</font></font>

318
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would make dying worthwhile."</font></font>

319
00:17:58,510 --> 00:17:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enough.</font></font>

320
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She'd never settle for mutual destruction.</font></font>

321
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's surely plotting something else.</font></font>

322
00:18:05,330 --> 00:18:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu, they say</font></font>

323
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like marries like.</font></font>

324
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:10,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really do know Her Ladyship</font></font>

325
00:18:10,310 --> 00:18:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">inside out.</font></font>

326
00:18:19,650 --> 00:18:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao, how did you even think of this?</font></font>

327
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You naughty girl!</font></font>

328
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You nearly scared me to death!</font></font>

329
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grandmother, keep your voice down.</font></font>

330
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:30,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't let him hear you.</font></font>

331
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've taken on the Crown Prince and the Empress Dowager.</font></font>

332
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're fearless! Who are you afraid will hear?</font></font>

333
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo. He's terrifying when he scolds me.</font></font>

334
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:45,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So a man can keep you in line after all?</font></font>

335
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that all you've got?</font></font>

336
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're always the kindest to me, Grandmother.</font></font>

337
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shouldn't have kept things from you.</font></font>

338
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to hit me, go ahead.</font></font>

339
00:18:58,720 --> 00:18:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...!</font></font>

340
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, you!</font></font>

341
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That little heart of yours is so black</font></font>

342
00:19:07,750 --> 00:19:11,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that no amount of scrubbing could get it clean.</font></font>

343
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's the Crown Prince, you know.</font></font>

344
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you really not afraid?</font></font>

345
00:19:16,830 --> 00:19:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hear the Crown Prince has broken his leg.</font></font>

346
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In the 150 years since our dynasty was founded,</font></font>

347
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we've never had a crown prince so lacking in virtue</font></font>

348
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and unable to walk properly.</font></font>

349
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not your place to say who should or shouldn't be Crown Prince.</font></font>

350
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the one who said it.</font></font>

351
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Empress Dowager has long resented me.</font></font>

352
00:19:40,590 --> 00:19:43,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She'll stop at nothing to have you killed.</font></font>

353
00:19:43,550 --> 00:19:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you plan to do next?</font></font>

354
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's what we'll do.</font></font>

355
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

356
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

357
00:20:09,090 --> 00:20:11,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know the whole story now.</font></font>

358
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:14,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How badly is your leg injured?</font></font>

359
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father, please give me justice.</font></font>

360
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:18,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zheng Tan, Grand Commandant, Lady Zheng's Eldest Brother]</font></font>

361
00:20:18,210 --> 00:20:21,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, Wu'an incited the mob</font></font>

362
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to beat the Crown Prince so severely.</font></font>

363
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The imperial physicians say his leg is beyond repair.</font></font>

364
00:20:25,850 --> 00:20:27,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He may never walk normally again.</font></font>

365
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:31,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Han and the Imperial Guards can testify to this.</font></font>

366
00:20:31,550 --> 00:20:33,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I beg Your Majesty to punish the ringleader,</font></font>

367
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:35,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble Lady Wu'an.</font></font>

368
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then what punishment</font></font>

369
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:38,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you propose?</font></font>

370
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty,</font></font>

371
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:44,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">first, Wu'an led a mob against Her Majesty's procession,</font></font>

372
00:20:44,110 --> 00:20:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">showing gross disrespect.</font></font>

373
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:48,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Second, she incited the refugees to riot,</font></font>

374
00:20:48,550 --> 00:20:49,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which amounts to treason.</font></font>

375
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:53,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wu'an, as the ringleader, should die by slow slicing.</font></font>

376
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:55,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All her followers should be hanged.</font></font>

377
00:20:55,300 --> 00:20:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make an example of them to deter others.</font></font>

378
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

379
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Crown Prince, the Grand Commandant, and Han Liao</font></font>

380
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all call for the death penalty?</font></font>

381
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We humbly await Your Majesty's judgment!</font></font>

382
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

383
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:17,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can I persuade Father</font></font>

384
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to show my sister mercy?</font></font>

385
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo.</font></font>

386
00:21:22,030 --> 00:21:22,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo?</font></font>

387
00:21:23,750 --> 00:21:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You needn't say anything, Your Highness,</font></font>

388
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or plead for Wei Rao.</font></font>

389
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone wants Rao dead.</font></font>

390
00:21:30,070 --> 00:21:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her life is at stake.</font></font>

391
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can I stay silent?</font></font>

392
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Love for your siblings is only natural,</font></font>

393
00:21:37,790 --> 00:21:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you must also consider your bond with your father.</font></font>

394
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes, silence</font></font>

395
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">speaks louder than any argument.</font></font>

396
00:21:45,830 --> 00:21:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Think carefully about what I've said,</font></font>

397
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you'll know what to do.</font></font>

398
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How is Rao?</font></font>

399
00:22:04,070 --> 00:22:05,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have the two imperial physicians I sent</font></font>

400
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">examined her?</font></font>

401
00:22:06,740 --> 00:22:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Summon them. I'll talk to them myself.</font></font>

402
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I took the physicians there,</font></font>

403
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but Her Ladyship was gravely ill</font></font>

404
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and too distressed to see anyone.</font></font>

405
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone, leave us.</font></font>

406
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:25,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship,</font></font>

407
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble Lady Wu'an had a maid lie in bed in her place.</font></font>

408
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She wasn't at the estate at all.</font></font>

409
00:22:36,300 --> 00:22:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Earl of Cheng'an's Residence]</font></font>

410
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Water.</font></font>

411
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyone?</font></font>

412
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shu, I've come to visit you.</font></font>

413
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You kindly helped the Crown Prince devise his plans,</font></font>

414
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet he took his anger out on you,</font></font>

415
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">refused to let you recover in his residence,</font></font>

416
00:23:21,070 --> 00:23:22,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and sent you back here.</font></font>

417
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How heartless of him.</font></font>

418
00:23:31,750 --> 00:23:32,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's this?</font></font>

419
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone at Xuanshi Palace wants you sentenced to death.</font></font>

420
00:23:37,510 --> 00:23:39,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Instead of clinging to Lady Li</font></font>

421
00:23:39,510 --> 00:23:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and begging for mercy,</font></font>

422
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you have time to come and gloat?</font></font>

423
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Trying to beg my forgiveness?</font></font>

424
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:02,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Too late.</font></font>

425
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:05,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll watch the executioner</font></font>

426
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">slice the flesh from your bones!</font></font>

427
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:08,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shu,</font></font>

428
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're both recovering from illness.</font></font>

429
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We both have time on our hands.</font></font>

430
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't we play a game?</font></font>

431
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What game?</font></font>

432
00:24:17,590 --> 00:24:19,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's wager</font></font>

433
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on whether His Majesty will have me killed.</font></font>

434
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The stake</font></font>

435
00:24:25,790 --> 00:24:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is your life.</font></font>

436
00:24:27,590 --> 00:24:30,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You injured the Crown Prince, attacked Her Majesty's procession,</font></font>

437
00:24:31,270 --> 00:24:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and led a rebellion. Your crimes are unforgivable.</font></font>

438
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:35,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You still think you can escape death?</font></font>

439
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're deluding yourself!</font></font>

440
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is the Crown Prince.</font></font>

441
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is the Fourth Prince, Liu Shuo.</font></font>

442
00:25:00,270 --> 00:25:01,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liu Shuo,</font></font>

443
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:03,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have you come to plead for your sister?</font></font>

444
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father,</font></font>

445
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before I entered,</font></font>

446
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had so much to say in her defense.</font></font>

447
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:13,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But now that I'm here,</font></font>

448
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:15,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I see how weary you look</font></font>

449
00:25:15,590 --> 00:25:16,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and how much weight you've lost.</font></font>

450
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You haven't fully recovered,</font></font>

451
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet you rushed back to the palace overnight.</font></font>

452
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My heart aches to see you ill, Father.</font></font>

453
00:25:23,750 --> 00:25:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I cannot suffer in your place,</font></font>

454
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I've already failed in my duty as a son.</font></font>

455
00:25:26,750 --> 00:25:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I dare not plead for my sister</font></font>

456
00:25:28,750 --> 00:25:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and add to your worries.</font></font>

457
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rise.</font></font>

458
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're still young. Stand aside and listen.</font></font>

459
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">People always favor their youngest sons.</font></font>

460
00:25:42,620 --> 00:25:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But the Crown Prince is the heir to the throne.</font></font>

461
00:25:45,930 --> 00:25:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He commands great respect and has saved His Majesty's life.</font></font>

462
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:51,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can a mere Liu Shuo compare?</font></font>

463
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Besides, the Crown Prince has</font></font>

464
00:25:56,550 --> 00:25:58,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Zheng family behind him.</font></font>

465
00:26:01,270 --> 00:26:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo,</font></font>

466
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:05,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Lu family has always been loyal, brave,</font></font>

467
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and a pillar of the realm.</font></font>

468
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you really betray His Majesty's favor</font></font>

469
00:26:09,020 --> 00:26:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and disregard the law because of one woman?</font></font>

470
00:26:13,030 --> 00:26:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When the people of Liangzhou and Bingzhou rose up,</font></font>

471
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty executed the powerful families who'd seized their land</font></font>

472
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and pardoned the people who rebelled.</font></font>

473
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What an emperor fears</font></font>

474
00:26:22,030 --> 00:26:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't peasants armed with farm tools</font></font>

475
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but the loss of their support.</font></font>

476
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As heir to the throne,</font></font>

477
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Crown Prince stormed the estate to settle a private grudge.</font></font>

478
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He provoked the people's outrage.</font></font>

479
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:36,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, how dare you!</font></font>

480
00:26:36,590 --> 00:26:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu invokes the precedent of sparing the masses</font></font>

481
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:39,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to try to clear Her Ladyship of guilt.</font></font>

482
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:42,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But in that case, powerful men drove the people to revolt.</font></font>

483
00:26:43,110 --> 00:26:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wu'an, however, deliberately incited the ignorant masses.</font></font>

484
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That is treason! Rebellion!</font></font>

485
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The two cases are entirely different!</font></font>

486
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wu'an endangered the realm and incited a revolt.</font></font>

487
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:54,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She must die, Your Majesty!</font></font>

488
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:58,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a look, Your Majesty.</font></font>

489
00:27:02,550 --> 00:27:05,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Imperial Guards took a shortcut through the fields</font></font>

490
00:27:05,500 --> 00:27:07,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and trampled vast stretches of wheat seedlings.</font></font>

491
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:09,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But these are more than seedlings.</font></font>

492
00:27:10,310 --> 00:27:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They embody the people's trust</font></font>

493
00:27:13,800 --> 00:27:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that Your Majesty works day and night to restore.</font></font>

494
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo!</font></font>

495
00:27:17,590 --> 00:27:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since ancient times, those bearing farm tools have been honest citizens,</font></font>

496
00:27:20,030 --> 00:27:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and those bearing weapons have been outlaws.</font></font>

497
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was it outraged citizens</font></font>

498
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or outlaws in rebellion</font></font>

499
00:27:26,590 --> 00:27:28,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who overturned Her Majesty's carriage?</font></font>

500
00:27:28,790 --> 00:27:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo...</font></font>

501
00:27:30,070 --> 00:27:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty rules with mercy, cautious in punishment and execution.</font></font>

502
00:27:33,030 --> 00:27:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wu'an sheltered the displaced and had them farm and grow mulberries.</font></font>

503
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:37,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You drove those farmers</font></font>

504
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to take up their tools as weapons.</font></font>

505
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:44,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You. You are the ones to blame.</font></font>

506
00:27:44,590 --> 00:27:46,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You are the ones who have betrayed this country!</font></font>

507
00:27:46,550 --> 00:27:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father,</font></font>

508
00:27:48,590 --> 00:27:49,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

509
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I only went because I heard Wu'an had falsified her identity.</font></font>

510
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:55,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't know, Father!</font></font>

511
00:27:57,350 --> 00:28:01,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An heir so foolish and incompetent, who has lost the people's support.</font></font>

512
00:28:01,790 --> 00:28:05,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can I entrust him with the realm and the people's welfare?</font></font>

513
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father, please show mercy beyond the letter of the law.</font></font>

514
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Spare my sister and those desperate people.</font></font>

515
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Lu family?</font></font>

516
00:28:21,350 --> 00:28:22,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, Wei Rao,</font></font>

517
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lady Li has schemed for years,</font></font>

518
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:27,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet the title of Empress remains beyond her reach,</font></font>

519
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:29,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all because the Zhou family has no powerful backer</font></font>

520
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to speak for her at court.</font></font>

521
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to admire</font></font>

522
00:28:35,070 --> 00:28:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the powerful marriage alliance</font></font>

523
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've secured for yourself.</font></font>

524
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:44,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No? What have I got wrong?</font></font>

525
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:46,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo</font></font>

526
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wouldn't let his feelings for me override the law</font></font>

527
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or use his position for personal gain.</font></font>

528
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If not the Lu family, then what?</font></font>

529
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu.</font></font>

530
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:00,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Duke of Ying's heir,</font></font>

531
00:29:00,350 --> 00:29:02,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so just and impartial, so free of personal bias,</font></font>

532
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has now let a woman</font></font>

533
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">make him disregard the law.</font></font>

534
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:12,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never thought I'd see the day.</font></font>

535
00:29:13,410 --> 00:29:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, you once condemned me for corruption</font></font>

536
00:29:17,570 --> 00:29:19,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and abusing my position for personal gain.</font></font>

537
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:21,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't what you've done today make you a hypocrite?</font></font>

538
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:25,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think His Majesty is hesitating</font></font>

539
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:27,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of the Lu family?</font></font>

540
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:29,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't he?</font></font>

541
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What disappointed His Majesty most</font></font>

542
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:38,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was that, to settle a private grudge,</font></font>

543
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Crown Prince openly displayed</font></font>

544
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his brutality, petty-mindedness,</font></font>

545
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and lawlessness before all the people.</font></font>

546
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The moment the Crown Prince's cavalry</font></font>

547
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">set foot in Zhuyu Estate,</font></font>

548
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'd already fallen into Wei Rao's trap.</font></font>

549
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty could never allow</font></font>

550
00:29:53,830 --> 00:29:57,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a foolish incompetent to be his heir.</font></font>

551
00:30:02,750 --> 00:30:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Unlike him, I have</font></font>

552
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:10,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">compassion, justice, and the people's support on my side.</font></font>

553
00:30:15,790 --> 00:30:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's still someone</font></font>

554
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:19,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who can sway His Majesty</font></font>

555
00:30:19,350 --> 00:30:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and decide the outcome.</font></font>

556
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:23,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao,</font></font>

557
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can't win.</font></font>

558
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:31,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Empress Dowager wants you dead.</font></font>

559
00:30:32,740 --> 00:30:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother, I've been coaxing you for so long.</font></font>

560
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please eat at least a little.</font></font>

561
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, my brother is wrong.</font></font>

562
00:30:41,070 --> 00:30:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll have him come here,</font></font>

563
00:30:42,500 --> 00:30:44,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you can scold him all you like. All right?</font></font>

564
00:30:45,130 --> 00:30:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's rebellious to the bone.</font></font>

565
00:30:48,140 --> 00:30:50,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whatever I tell him, he does the opposite.</font></font>

566
00:30:51,430 --> 00:30:53,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How is he my son?</font></font>

567
00:30:53,860 --> 00:30:57,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's more like that wretched Lady Zhou's child.</font></font>

568
00:31:01,110 --> 00:31:01,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave us.</font></font>

569
00:31:01,750 --> 00:31:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Celestial Splendor]</font></font>

570
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother,</font></font>

571
00:31:06,720 --> 00:31:08,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you mustn't say such things.</font></font>

572
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll break His Majesty's heart.</font></font>

573
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Greetings, Your Majesty.</font></font>

574
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:15,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now that he's Emperor,</font></font>

575
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he's forgotten</font></font>

576
00:31:17,350 --> 00:31:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the mother who bore and raised him, his own flesh and blood.</font></font>

577
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's as if he's bewitched.</font></font>

578
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:25,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He favors an official's wife,</font></font>

579
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">dotes on another man's daughter,</font></font>

580
00:31:28,350 --> 00:31:30,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and cares nothing for his own son.</font></font>

581
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At heart,</font></font>

582
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he resents me, his mother,</font></font>

583
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:38,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and treats that lowly wet nurse</font></font>

584
00:31:39,510 --> 00:31:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as his own mother instead.</font></font>

585
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you forgotten?</font></font>

586
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:48,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's still Lady Shou'an.</font></font>

587
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother,</font></font>

588
00:31:57,310 --> 00:31:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are you truly my mother?</font></font>

589
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you say such a thing?</font></font>

590
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ever since I can remember,</font></font>

591
00:32:06,750 --> 00:32:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only my wet nurse was there for me.</font></font>

592
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:10,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where</font></font>

593
00:32:11,550 --> 00:32:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was my own mother?</font></font>

594
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back then, life in the palace</font></font>

595
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was a constant struggle.</font></font>

596
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keeping you and your brother safe</font></font>

597
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:24,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was no easy task.</font></font>

598
00:32:24,350 --> 00:32:26,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I attend to everything?</font></font>

599
00:32:26,510 --> 00:32:28,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you still resent me over such trifles?</font></font>

600
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:30,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that really how it was?</font></font>

601
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I remember how</font></font>

602
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:36,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my brother and I went to the lake without our wet nurse knowing</font></font>

603
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and fell into the water.</font></font>

604
00:32:38,920 --> 00:32:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were rescued, but both became seriously ill.</font></font>

605
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">During the half month I lay ill,</font></font>

606
00:32:44,030 --> 00:32:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you stayed by my brother's side.</font></font>

607
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:47,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Yuniang, Lady Shou'an in Her Youth]</font></font>

608
00:32:47,830 --> 00:32:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you ever think of me?</font></font>

609
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The six-year-old Seventh Prince couldn't understand.</font></font>

610
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:56,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We were brothers born of the same mother.</font></font>

611
00:32:57,640 --> 00:32:58,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you</font></font>

612
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">favor one so much and neglect the other?</font></font>

613
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Later, I understood.</font></font>

614
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:09,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My brother</font></font>

615
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was talented and adored by Father.</font></font>

616
00:33:13,890 --> 00:33:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was your greatest asset in the struggle for power.</font></font>

617
00:33:17,290 --> 00:33:17,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I</font></font>

618
00:33:18,730 --> 00:33:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was nothing more</font></font>

619
00:33:20,290 --> 00:33:21,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">than a foolish child.</font></font>

620
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:23,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I compare with the brother</font></font>

621
00:33:23,510 --> 00:33:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who could bring you glory and power?</font></font>

622
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only when he died young of illness</font></font>

623
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:33,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and all your hopes were dashed</font></font>

624
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:36,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you finally think of me.</font></font>

625
00:33:38,590 --> 00:33:40,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I neglected you</font></font>

626
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and treated you coldly,</font></font>

627
00:33:44,030 --> 00:33:46,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're still my own flesh and blood.</font></font>

628
00:33:47,550 --> 00:33:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mine!</font></font>

629
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You shouldn't have grown close to a wet nurse</font></font>

630
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or granted that wretch a title.</font></font>

631
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:58,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've let the whole world know</font></font>

632
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:59,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that the Emperor</font></font>

633
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">treats his wet nurse as his own mother.</font></font>

634
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:05,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You even brought her widowed daughter into the palace.</font></font>

635
00:34:06,350 --> 00:34:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How you've humiliated me!</font></font>

636
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:10,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

637
00:34:11,550 --> 00:34:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you want to kill her,</font></font>

638
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the woman who fed your son at her own breast</font></font>

639
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:17,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and raised him,</font></font>

640
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who risked her life time and again</font></font>

641
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to protect me?</font></font>

642
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She never tried to take your place.</font></font>

643
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She kept telling me the same lie.</font></font>

644
00:34:33,030 --> 00:34:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She said,</font></font>

645
00:34:34,190 --> 00:34:35,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Your mother is very busy.</font></font>

646
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:38,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She'll come soon."</font></font>

647
00:34:39,190 --> 00:34:40,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you never did.</font></font>

648
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:42,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not once.</font></font>

649
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:44,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes,</font></font>

650
00:34:45,630 --> 00:34:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she fulfilled your duties as a mother.</font></font>

651
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But her place in my heart</font></font>

652
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:54,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was one you willingly gave up.</font></font>

653
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's ancient history.</font></font>

654
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no point dwelling on it.</font></font>

655
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, the whole world saw</font></font>

656
00:35:09,630 --> 00:35:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that mob overturn my imperial carriage.</font></font>

657
00:35:12,670 --> 00:35:14,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you regard me as your mother</font></font>

658
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and this country's Empress Dowager,</font></font>

659
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:19,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you must uphold my dignity</font></font>

660
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and execute Wu'an, the ringleader.</font></font>

661
00:35:24,150 --> 00:35:27,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill her! I order you to kill her!</font></font>

662
00:35:28,710 --> 00:35:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

663
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

664
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:38,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, Lady Shou'an has entered the palace.</font></font>

665
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:48,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty...</font></font>

666
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An emperor has only one mother.</font></font>

667
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I am the one who gave birth to you!</font></font>

668
00:36:01,190 --> 00:36:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao must die.</font></font>

669
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:07,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She must die!</font></font>

670
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

671
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hasn't Lady Shou'an arrived?</font></font>

672
00:36:23,630 --> 00:36:25,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother was here.</font></font>

673
00:36:25,590 --> 00:36:28,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She brought a basket of spring delicacies she'd prepared herself.</font></font>

674
00:36:28,820 --> 00:36:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She hoped to cheer you up</font></font>

675
00:36:31,630 --> 00:36:33,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and persuade you to pardon Rao.</font></font>

676
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If she came to plead,</font></font>

677
00:36:46,190 --> 00:36:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why did she leave?</font></font>

678
00:36:48,390 --> 00:36:51,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told Mother you were unwell.</font></font>

679
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:54,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've told you to stop taking elixirs,</font></font>

680
00:36:54,480 --> 00:36:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you won't listen.</font></font>

681
00:36:56,510 --> 00:36:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother grew anxious when she heard.</font></font>

682
00:36:59,610 --> 00:37:00,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She hurried home,</font></font>

683
00:37:00,940 --> 00:37:02,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">saying she had to find something called Baoyuan Pills,</font></font>

684
00:37:03,650 --> 00:37:06,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that they were made using a renowned Jiangnan physician's secret recipe,</font></font>

685
00:37:07,460 --> 00:37:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and that they could restore vitality and cure all ailments.</font></font>

686
00:37:10,290 --> 00:37:11,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She'd originally</font></font>

687
00:37:11,410 --> 00:37:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">been saving them for Rao.</font></font>

688
00:37:13,190 --> 00:37:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Afraid the maids wouldn't find them,</font></font>

689
00:37:14,880 --> 00:37:16,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she went to fetch them herself.</font></font>

690
00:37:22,510 --> 00:37:23,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She still remembers</font></font>

691
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how much I like these wild scallions.</font></font>

692
00:37:32,150 --> 00:37:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They taste just as I remember.</font></font>

693
00:37:41,670 --> 00:37:44,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aren't you going to plead for your daughter?</font></font>

694
00:37:45,110 --> 00:37:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Many at court now see her as a threat.</font></font>

695
00:37:47,860 --> 00:37:51,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They say she incited a revolt and has great ambitions.</font></font>

696
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's easily solved. Depose the Crown Prince</font></font>

697
00:37:56,030 --> 00:37:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and let Shuo take his place.</font></font>

698
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's Shuo's own sister.</font></font>

699
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would she rebel against her own brother?</font></font>

700
00:38:01,030 --> 00:38:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you!</font></font>

701
00:38:02,510 --> 00:38:06,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, I've overstepped and meddled in state affairs.</font></font>

702
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:08,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have my head, Your Majesty.</font></font>

703
00:38:10,590 --> 00:38:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

704
00:38:11,340 --> 00:38:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's enough.</font></font>

705
00:38:13,030 --> 00:38:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How many times have I told you?</font></font>

706
00:38:15,550 --> 00:38:17,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't let your feelings show.</font></font>

707
00:38:17,630 --> 00:38:19,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">However turbulent they are,</font></font>

708
00:38:19,070 --> 00:38:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">keep your composure.</font></font>

709
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you?</font></font>

710
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:24,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just can't keep your thoughts to yourself.</font></font>

711
00:38:24,590 --> 00:38:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I weren't protecting you,</font></font>

712
00:38:26,280 --> 00:38:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they'd have</font></font>

713
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">devoured you, bones and all!</font></font>

714
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Listen.</font></font>

715
00:38:30,590 --> 00:38:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From now on,</font></font>

716
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">those private thoughts</font></font>

717
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:34,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">must never be shared with outsiders.</font></font>

718
00:38:43,230 --> 00:38:44,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Actually, Your Majesty,</font></font>

719
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it doesn't matter whom you name Crown Prince.</font></font>

720
00:38:48,590 --> 00:38:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">May Your Majesty live a long life,</font></font>

721
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so my children and I can enjoy lasting peace.</font></font>

722
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Elixirs may preserve youth and prolong life,</font></font>

723
00:38:59,290 --> 00:39:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but they're potent and weaken the body with prolonged use.</font></font>

724
00:39:03,070 --> 00:39:05,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should take less of them.</font></font>

725
00:39:08,190 --> 00:39:09,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

726
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:16,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty,</font></font>

727
00:39:18,190 --> 00:39:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are you really going to kill my daughter?</font></font>

728
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't ask.</font></font>

729
00:39:34,190 --> 00:39:36,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make my own decision.</font></font>

730
00:39:37,220 --> 00:39:37,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

731
00:39:37,950 --> 00:39:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao has committed a monstrous crime.</font></font>

732
00:39:40,710 --> 00:39:42,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't believe</font></font>

733
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can save her this time.</font></font>

734
00:39:47,610 --> 00:39:50,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether she lives or dies, is executed or spared,</font></font>

735
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll know soon enough.</font></font>

736
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why the rush, Lord Han?</font></font>

737
00:40:05,110 --> 00:40:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's coming.</font></font>

738
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even an emperor is human.</font></font>

739
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And humans weigh the costs and benefits.</font></font>

740
00:40:17,250 --> 00:40:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">On one side, the Crown Prince, the Zheng family, and the Empress Dowager.</font></font>

741
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:20,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">On the other,</font></font>

742
00:40:21,230 --> 00:40:23,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liu Shuo, the people's support, and Lady Shou'an.</font></font>

743
00:40:24,510 --> 00:40:26,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once he's weighed them,</font></font>

744
00:40:26,920 --> 00:40:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which side will he choose?</font></font>

745
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perhaps I was born a gambler.</font></font>

746
00:40:36,320 --> 00:40:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll wager that he...</font></font>

747
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:45,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship, a decree has arrived from the palace.</font></font>

748
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Crown Prince let his troops destroy crops and harm the people.</font></font>

749
00:40:47,510 --> 00:40:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He is ordered to compensate the people</font></font>

750
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in full for their lost grain.</font></font>

751
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble Lady Wu'an failed to maintain discipline</font></font>

752
00:40:52,030 --> 00:40:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and allowed her troops to frighten the Empress Dowager.</font></font>

753
00:40:53,710 --> 00:40:55,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In view of her illness,</font></font>

754
00:40:55,230 --> 00:40:57,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her punishment is limited to forfeiture of three years' stipend</font></font>

755
00:40:57,960 --> 00:41:00,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and confinement to her residence to reflect on her conduct.</font></font>

756
00:41:01,620 --> 00:41:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Take a single chess piece♪</font></font>

757
00:41:03,100 --> 00:41:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And wager heaven and earth...♪</font></font>

758
00:41:04,070 --> 00:41:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No...</font></font>

759
00:41:07,660 --> 00:41:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Stir up a mighty storm...♪</font></font>

760
00:41:10,230 --> 00:41:11,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won.</font></font>

761
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

762
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:14,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why won't he kill you</font></font>

763
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:16,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">even after all this?</font></font>

764
00:41:17,360 --> 00:41:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The heaviest weight on your side is the Empress Dowager.</font></font>

765
00:41:20,030 --> 00:41:21,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She may be His Majesty's birth mother,</font></font>

766
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but years of coldness and estrangement have weakened that bond.</font></font>

767
00:41:24,880 --> 00:41:27,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It cannot outweigh the stability of his realm.</font></font>

768
00:41:28,480 --> 00:41:32,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His beloved consort, youngest son, wet nurse's love, and the people's support.</font></font>

769
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:33,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants them all.</font></font>

770
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's an emperor for you.</font></font>

771
00:41:38,110 --> 00:41:39,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's human nature.</font></font>

772
00:41:39,670 --> 00:41:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shut up!</font></font>

773
00:41:41,540 --> 00:41:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And wager heaven and earth...♪</font></font>

774
00:41:44,070 --> 00:41:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shu,</font></font>

775
00:41:47,440 --> 00:41:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the game's over.</font></font>

776
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No!</font></font>

777
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You haven't won!</font></font>

778
00:41:52,230 --> 00:41:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You haven't!</font></font>

779
00:42:00,030 --> 00:42:01,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's still a chance.</font></font>

780
00:42:02,440 --> 00:42:04,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There must be.</font></font>

781
00:42:06,030 --> 00:42:07,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Shu,</font></font>

782
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:10,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can't concede.</font></font>

783
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You mustn't let this break you.</font></font>

784
00:42:30,440 --> 00:42:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where have you been?</font></font>

785
00:42:37,510 --> 00:42:38,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're back, my dear.</font></font>

786
00:42:39,730 --> 00:42:40,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I went to visit Grandmother.</font></font>

787
00:42:41,040 --> 00:42:41,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liar.</font></font>

788
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:44,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're still ill, yet you keep running around.</font></font>

789
00:42:45,090 --> 00:42:46,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You clearly haven't taken a word I've said to heart.</font></font>

790
00:42:48,230 --> 00:42:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shouldn't have bothered worrying.</font></font>

791
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:53,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do as you please.</font></font>

792
00:42:57,110 --> 00:42:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be angry. I know I was wrong.</font></font>

793
00:43:01,440 --> 00:43:02,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where did you really go?</font></font>

794
00:43:06,030 --> 00:43:07,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right.</font></font>

795
00:43:07,320 --> 00:43:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll tell you.</font></font>

796
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:12,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even though you've seen</font></font>

797
00:43:13,110 --> 00:43:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all my faults for yourself,</font></font>

798
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for some reason,</font></font>

799
00:43:17,230 --> 00:43:19,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still want you to think of me</font></font>

800
00:43:19,230 --> 00:43:20,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as someone kinder</font></font>

801
00:43:22,110 --> 00:43:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and better.</font></font>

802
00:43:41,840 --> 00:43:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I went to see Wei Shu</font></font>

803
00:43:44,590 --> 00:43:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and kick her while she was down.</font></font>

804
00:43:47,360 --> 00:43:49,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I enjoyed it so much</font></font>

805
00:43:49,670 --> 00:43:51,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that I feel half recovered already.</font></font>

806
00:43:53,800 --> 00:43:55,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on, don't be angry.</font></font>

807
00:43:56,590 --> 00:43:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I promise I'll stay in bed and rest.</font></font>

808
00:43:59,030 --> 00:43:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No more running around.</font></font>

809
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you realize</font></font>

810
00:44:12,320 --> 00:44:13,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what you just said?</font></font>

811
00:44:15,030 --> 00:44:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I promised to rest and focus on getting well.</font></font>

812
00:44:27,840 --> 00:44:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as you remember.</font></font>

813
00:44:31,400 --> 00:44:32,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go to sleep without me tonight.</font></font>

814
00:44:33,550 --> 00:44:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something to attend to.</font></font>

815
00:44:40,180 --> 00:44:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Flourishing Like the Pines]</font></font>

816
00:45:02,230 --> 00:45:03,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come out.</font></font>

817
00:45:11,270 --> 00:45:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't get the wrong idea. I only came to see how she's doing.</font></font>

818
00:45:19,590 --> 00:45:20,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something to ask you.</font></font>

819
00:45:23,620 --> 00:45:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Blossoms of Grace]</font></font>

820
00:45:26,360 --> 00:45:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo,</font></font>

821
00:45:27,190 --> 00:45:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">actually, I came tonight...</font></font>

822
00:45:27,900 --> 00:45:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When a woman starts worrying</font></font>

823
00:45:29,040 --> 00:45:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about what kind of person you think she is,</font></font>

824
00:45:31,800 --> 00:45:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what do you think it means?</font></font>

825
00:45:34,670 --> 00:45:37,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It must mean she's fallen in love.</font></font>

826
00:45:39,030 --> 00:45:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

827
00:45:40,150 --> 00:45:41,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's always been decisive and ruthless,</font></font>

828
00:45:41,920 --> 00:45:43,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">indifferent to what others think.</font></font>

829
00:45:43,480 --> 00:45:44,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why else would she start caring</font></font>

830
00:45:45,030 --> 00:45:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">unless she'd fallen in love?</font></font>

831
00:45:47,800 --> 00:45:49,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, that must be it.</font></font>

832
00:45:51,480 --> 00:45:52,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're not sure,</font></font>

833
00:45:53,360 --> 00:45:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not ask her?</font></font>

834
00:45:55,040 --> 00:45:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why ask an outsider like me?</font></font>

835
00:45:57,320 --> 00:45:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one ever loved her properly as a child.</font></font>

836
00:45:59,190 --> 00:46:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She doesn't even understand her own feelings.</font></font>

837
00:46:01,010 --> 00:46:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What good would asking her do?</font></font>

838
00:46:01,880 --> 00:46:03,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perhaps you're just so lovesick</font></font>

839
00:46:04,070 --> 00:46:05,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're imagining things.</font></font>

840
00:46:15,840 --> 00:46:17,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who's imagining things now?</font></font>

841
00:46:17,960 --> 00:46:20,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This jade is naturally warm to the touch.</font></font>

842
00:46:20,550 --> 00:46:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wearing it will keep the cold at bay.</font></font>

843
00:46:27,590 --> 00:46:29,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please give it to Wei Rao for me</font></font>

844
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and wish her a speedy recovery.</font></font>

845
00:46:37,110 --> 00:46:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

846
00:46:42,480 --> 00:46:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to know whether she truly loves you,</font></font>

847
00:46:46,630 --> 00:46:48,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not find a chance to put it to the test?</font></font>

848
00:46:51,150 --> 00:46:52,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How?</font></font>

849
00:46:54,480 --> 00:46:55,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Figure it out yourself.</font></font>

850
00:47:26,020 --> 00:47:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The candlelight suddenly chills the window♪</font></font>

851
00:47:32,620 --> 00:47:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whose shadow stirs the ripples in another's heart?♪</font></font>

852
00:47:39,980 --> 00:47:46,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That sigh is soft yet thunders like a drum♪</font></font>

853
00:47:47,260 --> 00:47:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And leaves the world around us strangely still♪</font></font>

854
00:47:54,780 --> 00:48:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've grown used to walking through the cold♪</font></font>

855
00:48:01,780 --> 00:48:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen the broken shadows beneath all the splendor♪</font></font>

856
00:48:09,060 --> 00:48:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But like the wind you stir the calm within my eyes♪</font></font>

857
00:48:16,340 --> 00:48:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Until this game of testing has no winner or loser♪</font></font>

858
00:48:23,500 --> 00:48:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I forget how to breathe♪</font></font>

859
00:48:31,620 --> 00:48:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your gaze is like fire flickering yet searing my secrets♪</font></font>

860
00:48:38,940 --> 00:48:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The sharpness I've hidden inside my weakness♪</font></font>

861
00:48:44,420 --> 00:48:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Scatters into disarray the moment you lean close♪</font></font>

862
00:48:52,540 --> 00:49:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I hear my heartbeat break free♪</font></font>

863
00:49:00,740 --> 00:49:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who lost their plan and who lost their breath in this moment?♪</font></font>

864
00:49:08,020 --> 00:49:13,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even if you'll still be far beyond my reach♪</font></font>

865
00:49:13,580 --> 00:49:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪At least right now there's only an inch between us♪</font></font>
